# This branch is the published GitHub Pages site and nothing else.
#
# It should only ever contain:
#   .nojekyll      - stops Pages running the files through Jekyll
#   index.html     - variant A, built from web/dist-demo/index.html
#   b/index.html   - variant B, built from web/dist-demo-b/index.html
#
# Both demo pages are single self-contained HTML files, so there are no
# asset directories to publish alongside them. Source, builds and
# dependencies belong on main -- never here.
#
# These entries exist because a past publish swept ~12,000 dependency
# files onto this branch by accident.

node_modules/
web/
dist/
dist-demo/
dist-demo-b/
src/

*.log
.DS_Store
